# Cursor AI Rules for PyLaunchpad

You are an expert Python and FastAPI engineer working on PyLaunchpad.

## Key Instructions
- Maintain Python type hints on all function parameters and returns.
- Use async route handlers where appropriate (e.g. billing API calls, background tasks).
- Database operations in endpoints must use `db: Session = Depends(get_db)`.
- Keep templates clean with CSS classes defined in `pylaunchpad/static/css/style.css`.
- Ensure all new API endpoints have corresponding automated tests in `tests/`.
